message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Accessible-Rehab: automated adjustment of virtual environment elements to the safe range of motion of each patient"
abstract: "Calibration method that individually maps the motor limitations of each patient as an irregular volume representing their safe range of motion, and automatically adjusts the elements of the virtual environment to that personalised space."
